# figures/_out/ holds the main-figure panels (Figures 1-5) as PNG and EPS, and
# those are COMMITTED, not ignored, so a reader can download one without
# running anything. `make figures` rebuilds them from data/ and should leave
# them unchanged.

# The supplementary panels are not shipped rendered. `make supplementary`
# regenerates them into figures/_out/, where they stay untracked.
figures/_out/figS*

